# ── Secrets and per-device state — MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED ──
# Group keys, duress PINs, AP passwords, and device config are runtime artefacts.
# Git history is not retractable: if any of these land in a commit, the only fix
# is to rebuild the repository from a fresh initial commit.
*.key
psk.key
psk_v2.bin
duress.cfg
appass.cfg
batcal.cfg
gpsbaud.cfg
wifi_sta.cfg
tak_server.cfg
secrets.h
secrets.ini
credentials*
*.pem
*.p12
signing_key*
